g_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":13,"created_at":"2025-07-30T04:11:31Z","updated_at":"2025-08-29T17:04:38Z","closed_at":"2025-08-29T17:04:38Z","assignee":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.5 beta 3 and 5. \nNot reproducible in Godot 4.4\n\n### System information\n\nQuest 3, Valve Index\n\n### Issue description\n\nCreating a windows release build and playing it with a non-default OpenXR_Action_Set will create per frame error saying action_sets are empty.\nI say non-default because im still trying to figure out what the fuck bugs the bastard out, Just saving the default OpenXR_Action_Set creates multiple OpenXR errors. Im concerned it might be something to do with the saving system? It may also be a data issue, seeing as any notable change in the default creates issues.\nThis error happens with Quest Link and SteamVR. \n\n\n\nThis error does not happen in-editor. \nNotably SteamVR refuses to even think about creating Controller Bindings, but, i mean, thats kinda the issue with not having action sets.\n```\nOpenXR: failed to attach action sets! [ XR_ERROR_VALIDATION_FAILURE ]\nOpenXR: Configuring interface\nOpenXR: Session begun\n\nERROR: Condition \"active_sets.is_empty()\" is true. Returning: false\n   at: sync_action_sets (modules/openxr/openxr_api.cpp:3463)\nERROR: Condition \"active_sets.is_empty()\" is true. Returning: false\n   at: sync_action_sets (modules/openxr/openxr_api.cpp:3463)\nERROR: Condition \"active_sets.is_empty()\" is true. Returning: false\n   at: sync_action_sets (modules/openxr/openxr_api.cpp:3463)\n[Continues for runtime]\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create or Port a Vr Project\n- Create and save unique OpenXr_Action_set\n- Build Debug Project\n- Play with Console\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI mean, Its a action_set error, just not having it means controllers wont track and your console fills with blood. so its basically just checking the log after building. Heres the project I've been using trying to debug it. \nIt's happened in my main project and the MRP below\n\n[vr-release-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21500948/vr-release-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Fire551","id":52729867,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzI5ODY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52729867?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551","html_url":"https://github.com/Fire551","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fire551/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109107/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}